Package: modeldash
Title: NBA Model Dashboard
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Oliver", "Eaton", , "eat_fred@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Accuracy monitoring and per-game forecasts for the NBA predictive
    models. Bakes the published model views at build time and reports
    calibration, point error, drift and coverage for each registered model,
    alongside the player stat projections.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/shaggycamel/scs.nba.mod.model_dash.git
BugReports: https://github.com/shaggycamel/scs.nba.mod.model_dash.git/issues
